      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>My understand from what we decided in the <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/2016-08-18+-+Fedora+Tech+Meeting\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Tech call</a> is that we don't expect to we don't expect to solve this problem fully in Fedora at this time.  The task that I've taken on for this ticket is to make sure the documentation is clear about what the Fedora versions are able to express.</p>\n\n<p>Which documentation were we thinking of updating? The JavaDocs? Something else?</p>",
