  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": "<p>Create a container structure like this<br/>\n/rest/project/inner1/inner2/inner3</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Create a version V1 for /rest/project</li>\n\t<li>Create a version V2 for /rest/project/inner1</li>\n\t<li>Create a version V3 for /rest/project/inner1/inner2</li>\n\t<li>Create a version V4 for /rest/project/inner1/inner2/inner3</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Now traverse the fcr:versions path from /rest/project/fcr:versions/V1<br/>\nYou will notice like this <br/>\nldp: contains<br/>\n<a href=\"http://fedoradev0.icpsr.umich.edu:8097/fedora/rest/project/inner1/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedoradev0.icpsr.umich.edu:8097/fedora/rest/project/inner1/fcr:versions</a></p>\n\n<p>Here this is ambiguous because it is unclear which version of inner1 is participating in this version if /inner2 had multiple versions. In fact in this instance V1 was created first so it should be all children listed as-is.</p>",
